> > >>
> > >>
> > >> On 24/01/2019 09:07, Erin Lo wrote:
> > >>> From: Seiya Wang <seiya.wang@mediatek.com>
> > >>>
> > >>> To support partitioned PPIs, 4 interrupt parameters should be valid
> > >>> for sysirq.
> > >>>
